oduce**\r\nSpecify the `quarkus.kubernetes-config.enabled: \"true\"` in the application.yml like this:\r\n\r\n```\r\n  kubernetes:\r\n    env:\r\n      configmaps: my-config-map\r\n      vars:\r\n        quarkus.kubernetes-config.enabled: \"true\"\r\n  kubernetes-config:\r\n    enabled: false\r\n    config-maps: my-config-map\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Configuration**\r\n```\r\n  kubernetes:\r\n    env:\r\n      configmaps: my-config-map\r\n      vars:\r\n        quarkus.kubernetes-config.enabled: \"true\"\r\n  kubernetes-config:\r\n    enabled: false\r\n    config-maps: my-config-map\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Screenshots**\r\n(If applicable, add screenshots to help explain your problem.)\r\n\r\n**Environment (please complete the following information):**\r\n - Output of `uname -a` or `ver`: \r\n  ```\r\n Darwin NMOL538577.local 20.3.0 Darwin Kernel Version 20.3.0: Mon Dec  7 22:04:02 PST 2020; root:xnu-7195.80.16.111.1~1/RELEASE_X86_64 x86_64\r\n ```\r\n - Output of `java -version`: \r\n  ```\r\nopenjdk version \"11.0.9.1\" 2020-11-04\r\nOpenJDK Runtime Environment AdoptOpenJDK (build 11.0.9.1+1)\r\nOpenJDK 64-Bit Server VM AdoptOpenJDK (build 11.0.9.1+1, mixed mode)\r\n ```\r\n - GraalVM version (if different from Java): \r\n - Quarkus version or git rev: `1.10.5.Final`\r\n - Build tool (ie. output of `mvnw --version` or `gradlew --version`): \r\n ```\r\n Apache Maven 3.6.3 (cecedd343002696d0abb50b32b541b8a6ba2883f)\r\nMaven home: /Users/user1/.m2/wrapper/dists/apache-maven-3.6.3-bin/1iopthnavndlasol9gbrbg6bf2/apache-maven-3.6.3\r\nJava version: 11.0.9.1, vendor: AdoptOpenJDK, runtime: /Library/Java/JavaVirtualMachines/adoptopenjdk-11.jdk/Contents/Home\r\nDefault locale: en_IT, platform encoding: UTF-8\r\nOS name: \"mac os x\", version: \"10.16\", arch: \"x86_64\", family: \"mac\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\nKubernates cluster\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"geoand","id":4374975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNzQ5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4374975?v=4",